[I] Collection of programs for accessing Mega.nz service

[T] megatools is a collection of command line programs for accessing the
[T] Mega.nz cloud storage. It allows copying files and directory trees to
[T] and from the cloud, downloading public links without an account,
[T] creating public links and streaming downloads.

[U] https://xff.cz/megatools/

[A] Megatools Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

